## Source Of Truth Priority
1. architecture-decisions.md
2. requirements.md and prd.md
3. techstack.md, backend.md, frontend.md
4. api-docs.md, database.md, security.md, flow.md
5. status.md

If conflicts are detected, follow this order and align implementation to the highest-priority file.
